### Predecessor context (NOT used for scoring)

For reference only, the preceding Qwen 3.7-Max scored: GPQA Diamond ~92.4%, LiveCodeBench ~91.6%, SWE-bench Pro ~60.6%, Chatbot Arena Elo ~1506 (Qwen 3.8-Max). These scores apply to the predecessor generation and are NOT transferable to Qwen 4 Max's evaluation.

### Negative findings summary

Qwen 4 Max is a pre-release flagship model currently in early preview. No official benchmark data, technical paper, or finalized evaluation scorecard has been published. The model has appeared on Chatbot Arena under anonymous canary codenames but without disclosed scores. Self-exclusion applies per template rules.

